--  What the launcher of a process holds for it (#99): it can find the
--  interface that the process publishes, and end it (ADR 0015). It can't
--  change the process's address space or act as the process, as the
--  process's own Process cap can. Mem serves it, one for each process,
--  and Launch.Launch returns it.

interface Processes.Process_Control : Processes.Server, Caps.Cap is
end Processes.Process_Control;
